# A Codex app-server that completes the handshake and then hangs: it
# ignores stdin EOF and never answers again, so only a kill ends it. Run
# through codex.cmd (Windows) or codex.sh (Unix) by the adapter's shim test
# (crates/swarm-core/src/agent/codex/tests.rs). The fake records its pid
# (`{"fake":"started"}`) before it reads this script.
#DIRECTIVE EXPECT_REQUEST initialize
#DIRECTIVE RESPOND_INITIALIZE
#DIRECTIVE EXPECT_NOTIFICATION initialized
#DIRECTIVE EXPECT_REQUEST thread/start
#DIRECTIVE RESPOND_THREAD_START 019a7c00-0000-7000-8000-000000000001
#DIRECTIVE IGNORE_STDIN_EOF
#DIRECTIVE HANG
